{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","维伦"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长制造范围伤害的战士，开启强化状态后可提升作战能力。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","遵命，遵命，让我来看看发生了什么——"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Yes, as you command. Now, what seems to be the problem?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不管怎么说，有进步总比停滞不前好，对吧？"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Little progress is better than no progress, right?"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","来，看着我——的每一剑。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","It's time to show you my moves!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失败也是人生的一部分……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Ah... Defeat... is just another part... of life...."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","啊哈，意料之中。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Just as I expected."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","需要帮忙吗，朋友？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","奉将军之命，我会保护你，暂时如此。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","这把剑暂时还没到他出场的时机呢。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","所谓的剑术就是用华丽的花招混淆视线，一击绝杀。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我很喜欢——事先说明，这话可不是在奉承你。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","竟然破费给我东西？你这人很大方嘛。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","浪心剑客"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","比起将军的任务，他更在意今晚酒馆的折扣。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","喋血特工"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","来我身后，我会保护你立即撤离。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","不错，放松的好地方"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","报告明天再交也来得及吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这儿的推荐是什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要来一起欣赏雪景吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","想要怎样的礼物？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要不要尝点什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要不要一起去放焰火？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","维伦曾与为恶的领主雇佣的剑术家展开决斗，并凭借自己绝妙的技艺获得了胜利——轻松躲过剑术家狂风骤雨般的攻击，精准地砍断了对方的腰带。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","最近维伦执行监视任务的成功率有所下降。因为他跟踪目标时，总有曾受过帮助的居民热情地向他打招呼。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","“从盗匪手中救下我的那一刻，维伦先生那潇洒的英姿就深深地印刻在我的脑海中了。”——圣石镇居民，玛丽小姐"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","旅人灯火的服务生透露，维伦曾在他面前用过9种不同的动作翻转手腕，舞出剑花。而他自己尝试偷学时，练习剑脱手飞出，直戳进了酒馆标志性的大木桶里。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","维伦曾经帮助村民铲除危险的恶霸，村民们集资作为报酬，维伦只接受了一枚鸡蛋。据他自己说，这是他最喜爱的食物。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","一名黑赌场的老板入狱后大惊失色，他发现自己面前的审讯者维伦竟然就是当初连胜自己数局的顾客。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","“我们私底下讨论很久了，但没人知道真相。霍根将军当年到底是怎么抓住队长的啊？”——隐士某成员。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","“维伦这小子，远比你看到的要可靠得多。”——霍根。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","圣石镇的女孩们会聚在一起谈论维伦的情史，却从没有人见过他真的把女孩拿下。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","失踪的宝剑“咏雷者”至今下落不明，据黑市商人的供词，他们曾在当晚的拍卖会上见过肖似维伦的身影。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，科丝蒂小姐应该是正式经受过培训的魔法师吧？\n咒语和研究方法看起来都很专业。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 科丝蒂 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","那个维拉夫人，到底是什么来头……"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411040.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 维拉"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","唔……肚子饿了。漫漫，你那里有什么好吃的？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411050.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 漫漫 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/2/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/3/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","真想找时间去喝上一杯。"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411060.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","圣石镇"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","格罗登平原"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/2/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","金穗村的季度粮食产量，确认。\n综合收购方案第三款，确认。\n金穗村及格罗登平原全域道路保障及维护，确认。"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415022.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","罗万 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","不错，放松的好地方"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415058.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","这儿的推荐是什么？"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415059.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","外面居然下起雪来了，倒是很有氛围嘛。"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415341.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 米瑞尔"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","要来一起欣赏雪景吗？"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415363.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","想要怎样的礼物？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415364.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","维伦"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","要不要尝点什么？"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn